---
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
import HeroGallery from "./HeroGallery.astro";
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 right-0 hidden w-[55%] lg:block bg-[radial-gradient(60%_60%_at_70%_40%,rgba(11,103,73,0.06),transparent_70%)]"
  />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-20 pt-16 sm:px-6 sm:pt-24 lg:px-8 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-28">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="max-w-2xl lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <h1 class="text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl xl:text-6xl">
          Tu cartera de inversiones, <span class="text-brand">controlada</span>.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-pretty text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Conectá tu cuenta de InvertirOnline y mirá portafolio, cotizaciones, análisis y reportes en un solo lugar. Solo lectura: nunca ejecutamos órdenes.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <a
            href={SITE.registerUrl}
            class="rounded-lg bg-brand px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:brightness-110 active:scale-[0.98]"
          >
            Crear cuenta gratis
          </a>
          <a
            href="/funcionalidades"
            class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:border-foreground/25 hover:bg-surface"
          >
            Ver funcionalidades
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-9 text-sm text-muted">Solo lectura · Conectá tu IOL · Sin ejecutar órdenes</p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal>
        <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] bg-surface p-2 ring-1 ring-border shadow-[0_24px_80px_-32px_rgba(6,64,40,0.25)]">
          <HeroGallery />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
